#, no-python-format, python-format
msgid ""
"Even at 100% readiness, this build does not delete Nginx cache files, edit "
"configuration or restart services. The next host bridge must require "
"explicit approval, exact before-state, read-back, Runtime Acceptance and "
"rollback."
