msgstr ""
"Impossible de lire le fichier advanced-cache.php de W3 Total Cache pour "
"préparer le retour arrière."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php could not be removed with verified "
"read-back."
msgstr ""
"Impossible de supprimer le fichier advanced-cache.php de W3 Total Cache avec"
" une relecture vérifiée."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The W3 Total Cache plugin is inactive, but advanced-cache.php still requires"
" the protected final cleanup shown in Step 5 above."
msgstr ""
"L’extension W3 Total Cache est inactive, mais advanced-cache.php nécessite "
"encore le nettoyage final protégé indiqué à l’étape 5 ci-dessus."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
